OL,3,GNEWSANew lease for football club which
OL,4,Ais 'pride' of town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey football club is set to be
OL,7,Fgranted a 25-year lease on its ground
OL,8,Fafter successive promotions cemented it
OL,9,Fas source of "genuine community pride".
OL,11,FFarnham Town Football Club enjoyed its
OL,12,Fthird successive promotion last year,
OL,13,Fand it must now comply with criteria
OL,14,Fset out by the Football Association to
OL,15,Fbe in the National League South.
OL,17,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,18,FReporting Service, the new lease set to
OL,19,Fbe granted by Waverley Borough Council
OL,20,Fincludes an area of land next to the
OL,21,Fclub's Memorial Hall car park.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
