OL,3,GNEWSANew lease for football club which
OL,4,Ais 'pride' of town
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Merryweather, executive
OL,7,Fmember for finance, said it is a "real
OL,8,Fpleasure" to back a move of economic
OL,9,Fbenefit which is also the source of
OL,10,F"genuine community pride".
